# GitHub mirror repos for dsh-plugins plugin dirs (one dir per line; repo = hy-sde/<dir>).
#
# The monorepo is the source of truth; scripts/sync-mirrors.mjs pushes the
# `git subtree split` history of each dir to its mirror so every plugin stays
# individually searchable on GitHub (topics / stars / issues), matching the
# ecosystem convention of one repo per plugin.
#
# - dsh-stream-rules is RETIRED (dir removed from the workspace) — its repo is
#   intentionally left archived and is NOT listed here.
# - Repos without an existing hy-sde/<dir> remote (dsh-graph, dsh-memory-extraction,
#   dsh-pi-durable, dsh-session-intelligence, dsh-tool-library-search) are CREATED
#   by `sync-mirrors.mjs --stamp`.
# - dsh-omp-native is the Rust sidecar (no npm packages) — still mirrored.

dsh-av
dsh-browser
dsh-code-runtime-kernels
dsh-fs-archive
dsh-git
dsh-graph
dsh-internal-urls
dsh-llm-slots
dsh-logseq
dsh-memory
dsh-memory-extraction
dsh-omp-native
dsh-openwiki
dsh-orchestration-policy
dsh-pi-durable
dsh-session-intelligence
dsh-session-url
dsh-tool-ast
dsh-tool-codebase-memory
dsh-tool-debug
dsh-tool-edit
dsh-tool-library-search
dsh-tool-subagent-report
